# Files that stay in the repo and out of the distributed package.
# Exact relative paths, one per line. modkit matches literally, no globs.

# The render harness and the sheet composer. These are development tools: they
# run by hand on a machine that has already imported its own ROM, they load
# main.lua under a stub of the host API, and they read the player's generated
# sprite cache to build geometry from real art. That last part is why they
# cannot ship: modkit's MK301 rejects any lua that names assets/generated,
# and it is right to, because a distributed mod has no business pointing at
# that tree. Nothing here is loaded by the mod at runtime.
tools/render/main.lua
tools/render/check.sh
tools/render/conf.lua
tools/render/README.md
tools/render/compose/main.lua
tools/render/compose/conf.lua

# The suite. It requires engine modules through package.path, which reads as a
# private require against the archive, and it is meaningless without the repo.
tests/voxel_chars_test.lua

# Field notes. Useful to contributors, noise to players.
docs/FIELD_REPORTS.md

# Comparison renders for the release notes. Documentation, not mod content.
docs/images/walk.png
docs/images/faces.png
docs/images/ground.png
docs/images/blink.png
docs/images/itemball.png
docs/images/exposure.png

# O gate in-game: um driver POKEPORT_DRIVER e o runner que o dispara. Roda o
# jogo de verdade para fotografar o mod em varios angulos de camera, contra o
# mundo real e na escala real de tela, que e o que o harness offline nao
# consegue mostrar. Ferramenta de desenvolvimento, nao conteudo do mod.
tools/ingame/driver.lua
tools/ingame/run.sh

# A sonda do passo 1 do roadmap: envolve Voxel3D.draw no jogo rodando e mede se
# a posicao por instancia chega limpa. So medicao, nao muda nada. Ferramenta.
tools/ingame/probe_draw.lua

# O gate numerico do canal de vida: mede em pixel, no jogo rodando, se a
# respiracao chega na tela e se responde ao menu. Ferramenta, nao conteudo.
tools/ingame/probe_life.lua

# O escolhedor de pouso: valida a celula antes de largar o jogador nela, para o
# gate nao fotografar ninguem em cima de placa ou de mesa. Ferramenta.
tools/ingame/pouso.lua

# O gravador de clipe: mp4 e gif lado a lado de uma opcao ligada e desligada.
# Foto nao julga movimento; estes tres arquivos existem para isso. Ferramenta.
tools/ingame/clip.lua
tools/ingame/clip.sh

# O gate do menu de verdade e o conferidor de release. Ferramentas.
tools/ingame/menu.lua
tools/release_check.sh

# Mais renders de comparacao para as notas de release.
docs/images/walk-offset.png
docs/images/blink-walk.png

# O roadmap da proxima direcao. Documentacao de projeto, nao conteudo do mod.
docs/ROADMAP.md

# O handoff da sessao. Documentacao de processo, nao conteudo do mod.
docs/HANDOFF.md
